{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-p042a","title":"吴临江作疑城曹丕惮而退赵达占后运","accounts":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-p042a-account","label":"干宝《晋纪》","text":"吴临江作疑城曹丕惮而退赵达占后运","evidence":["wuzhu-e-p042a-q"]},{"id":"chenghuang-a-8967863e7a81d7618d75","label":"正文","text":"盛建计筑围文帝望而退","evidence":["chenghuang-q-6c71787d582757066a4d"]}],"participants":[{"person":"sun-quan","role":"设疑问占","evidence":["wuzhu-e-p042a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0170","role":"退军","evidence":["wuzhu-e-p042a-q"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0050","role":"占算","evidence":["wuzhu-e-p042a-q"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0030","role":"建计从建业筑围作薄落围上设假楼江中浮船、诸将以为无益不听固立之","evidence":["chenghuang-q-6c71787d582757066a4d"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"曹丕至广陵时","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["wuzhu-e-p042a-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"wuzhu-e-p042a-q","source_order":[47,384,"P042a"],"order":8262}],"persons":[{"id":"sun-quan","name":"孙权","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0170","name":"曹丕","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wuzhu-p0030","name":"徐盛","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wuzhu-p0050","name":"赵达","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"chenghuang-q-6c71787d582757066a4d","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-ffa00a8bed2586642de8","layer":"original","quote":"后魏文帝大出，有渡江之志。盛建计从建业筑围〖9〗，作薄落〖10〗；围上设假楼，江中浮船。诸将以为无益，盛不听，固立之。文帝到广陵，望围愕然，弥漫数百里；而江水盛长，便引军退：诸将乃伏","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":312,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":91,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-e-p042a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-f9b2d8cafa27af1b92ad","layer":"pei","quote":"魏文帝之在广陵，吴人大骇。乃临江为疑城，自石头至于江乘；车以木桢，衣以苇席，加采饰焉：一夕而成。魏人自江西望，甚惮之，遂退军。权令赵达算之，曰：‘曹丕走矣！虽然，吴衰庚子岁。’权曰：‘几何？’达屈指而计之，曰：‘五十八年。’权曰：‘今日之忧，不暇及远：此子孙事也！’","attribution":"干宝《晋纪》","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":383,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-f2364975efe3e0fa778d","start":12,"end":145,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
